# List title search

`pebbles list --search <query>` fuzzy-matches issue titles
(case-insensitive, subsequence matching with word-boundary bonuses) and
sorts by match quality, best first. It composes with the existing
--status and --issue-type filters.

Fixture store: 555 (Log out flow design, proposed design),
444 (Export users to CSV, done usecase), 333 (User can login with email
and password, in progress usecase), 222 (JWT token authentication system,
todo design), 111 (Login button doesn't respond on mobile, todo bug).

## Baseline list (updated_at descending)

```console
$ pebbles list
555 [des] [PROPOSED] Log out flow design ✓
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## --no-color parses (r[verify no-color-flag])

The flag is root-level global: accepted before or after the subcommand.
trycmd runs piped, so colors are already suppressed and the output equals
the plain list; the precedence matrix itself is covered by the
`should_color` unit tests (flag > NO_COLOR/CLICOLOR > tty).

```console
$ pebbles --no-color list
555 [des] [PROPOSED] Log out flow design ✓
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

```console
$ pebbles list --no-color
555 [des] [PROPOSED] Log out flow design ✓
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓
222 [des] [TODO] JWT token authentication system ✓
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Fuzzy title match, best match first

The query matches contiguously in "Login button..." and "User can login
...", and as a subsequence in "Log out flow design" (the `i` and `n` of
"design").

```console
$ pebbles list --search login
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓
555 [des] [PROPOSED] Log out flow design ✓

```

## Search composes with --status

```console
$ pebbles list --search login --status todo
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with --issue-type

```console
$ pebbles list --search login --issue-type bug
111 [bug] [TODO] Login button doesn't respond on mobile ✓

```

## Search composes with --status and --issue-type

```console
$ pebbles list --search login --status in_progress --issue-type usecase
333 [uc] [IN PROGRESS] User can login with email and password ✓

```

## Case-insensitive matching

```console
$ pebbles list --search CSV
444 [uc] [DONE] Export users to CSV

```

## No match

```console
$ pebbles list --search zzzz
No issues found.

```

## Blank query matches nothing

An explicitly blank --search is a distinct filter, not the unfiltered
list.

```console
$ pebbles list --search ""
No issues found.

```
